// Metabind project settings — the client-writable projection of `metabind project get`.
// Prose fields are files: ./mcp-instructions.md (settings.mcp.instructions),
// ./agent/system-prompt.md (settings.agent.systemPrompt).
// Server-stamped fields (id, timestamps, mcpUrl, publish version) live in .metabind/state.json,
// which is not tracked — see .gitignore.
// Fields outside this file (permissions, …) are web-administered — push never touches them.
// `thumbnail` references an asset by name; sync resolves it against your own project.
//
// settings.mcp.icons is deliberately absent. An icon is a CDN URL stamped with the
// org, project and asset ids that own it, so it cannot be checked in and mean
// anything in a different project. Upload the icon after syncing and set it then —
// see README.md.
{
  "description": "Personal finance demo",
  "name": "Banking Assistant",
  "settings": {
    "thumbnail": "project-thumbnail.png"
  },
  "slug": "finance-app",
  "type": "mcp"
}
